{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,200p' solver_index.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Generated solver source index\n\nUse line ranges to inspect only definitions relevant to the current level.\n\n## players.py\n- L6--7 `def play_level_1(env):`; calls: align_horizontal_indicator\n- L10--11 `def play_level_2(env):`; calls: align_indicator_with_transfers\n- L14--17 `def play_level_3(env): # Recovered from verified proposer path artifact: checkpoint.json+/Users/sasha/gkm/output/arc_agi3_gpt61_zero_seed_20261116T144404Z/source/arc/crack_lab/runs/scratch/gkm_legs_ws_vc33_arc_agi3_n0_fresh_frontier_ujd0or1`\n- L20--23 `def play_level_4(env): # Recovered from verified proposer path artifact: checkpoint.json+/Users/sasha/gkm/output/arc_agi3_gpt61_zero_seed_20261116T144404Z/source/arc/crack_lab/runs/scratch/gkm_legs_ws_vc33_arc_agi3_n0_fresh_frontier_bh2kb6j`\n\n## legs.py\n- L6--31 `def align_horizontal_indicator(env, max_moves=16):` — Use paired vertical buttons to align a movable marker with a rail mark.; calls: connected_components, int, len, range, safe_step, sorted\n- L34--65 `def align_indicator_with_transfers(env, max_moves=32):` — Align a marker by transferring width through an intermediate reservoir.; calls: connected_components, int, len, range, safe_step, sorted, sum\n- L68--134 `def align_reservoir_chain(env, max_moves=64):` — Route stock through adjacent reservoirs to match colored height marks.; calls: abs, any, connected_components, distance, heights, int, len, max, min, range, +4\n- L137--221 `def float_through_locks(env, max_states=4000):` — Equalize lock levels, cross, then lift a floating figure to its mark.; calls: abs, connected_components, deque, int, len, list, min, next, range, safe_step, +4\n\n## perception.py\n- L23--36 `class Blob:`; calls: dataclass\n- L39--40 `def arr(frame) -> np.ndarray:`\n- L43--45 `def color_counts(frame) -> Dict[int, int]:`; calls: arr, int, zip\n- L48-