— Path-only BFS for games whose deep Arena clones become expensive.; calls: action_fn, arr, deque, goal_fn, key_fn, len, normalize_public_action, reconstruct, safe_step, tuple\n- L290--291 `def level_goal(base_level: int):`\n\n## solve.py\n- L3--13 `def solve(env): # dispatch to the per-level player for the current level, in a loop`; calls: fn, getattr\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
